# Code Owners for IaC Security Guardrails
# These owners will be automatically requested for review when someone opens a pull request.

# Default owners for everything in the repo
*       @yourorg/iac-security-team

# Core Python code
*.py    @yourorg/python-maintainers
/iac_guard.py @yourorg/core-maintainers

# Security policies
/policies/opa/*.rego @yourorg/security-team @yourorg/policy-maintainers

# Documentation
*.md    @yourorg/documentation-team
/docs/  @yourorg/documentation-team

# CI/CD configurations
/.github/workflows/ @yourorg/devops-team
/ci/    @yourorg/devops-team

# Terraform examples
/iac/terraform/ @yourorg/terraform-experts

# Tests
/tests/ @yourorg/qa-team

# Scripts and automation
/scripts/   @yourorg/devops-team
/scanners/  @yourorg/security-team

# Dependencies
/requirements.txt   @yourorg/dependency-managers
